    [6664]={name="Voodoo Mantle",quality=2,ilvl=26,reqLevel=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Jin'Zil's Forest Magic'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Witch Doctor Jin'Zil in Stonetalon Mountains. Objective: Witch Doctor Jin'Zil at Malaka'jin wants 5 portions of Stonetalon Sap, 5 Twilight Whiskers, 30 Courser Eyes and a Fey Dragon Scale.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="Jin'Zil's Forest Magic",lore="So excited I am! Three little cages for three little elves! But what shall we do with our lovely tree-hugging friends? Why, let's give them a taste of..."},
    [6667]={name="Engineer's Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=27,reqLevel=16,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Ziz Fizziks in Stonetalon Mountains. Objective: Bring Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle's Mechanical Arm to Ziz Fizziks in the Stonetalon Mountains.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle",lore="I met Gerenzo once, but let me tell you, he's not easy on the eyes. His flesh looks like it's rotting away, and he's grafted metal and gears onto his body, replaced some of his limbs with mechanical ones."},
    [6668]={name="Draftsman Boots",quality=2,ilvl=27,reqLevel=16,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Ziz Fizziks in Stonetalon Mountains. Objective: Bring Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle's Mechanical Arm to Ziz Fizziks in the Stonetalon Mountains.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle",lore="I met Gerenzo once, but let me tell you, he's not easy on the eyes. His flesh looks like it's rotting away, and he's grafted metal and gears onto his body, replaced some of his limbs with mechanical ones."},
    [6670]={name="Panther Armor",quality=2,ilvl=27,reqLevel=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Den'. Starts with Braelyn Firehand in Stonetalon Mountains. Objective: Travel to the Den on Stonetalon Peak. Using the Gatekeeper's Key, obtain the druids' hidden items. Use these items to open the Talon Den Hoard.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="The Den",lore="The druids built the Talon Den on Stonetalon Peak, where they keep many powerful items. They devised a complex scheme to keep them from falling into the wrong hands."},
    [6681]={name="Thornspike",quality=3,ilvl=32,reqLevel=27,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Aggem Thorncurse.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",npc="Aggem Thorncurse",proc="Chance on hit: Hurl spikes at the target, dealing 45 Physical damage and jumping to 1 additional nearby enemy. Each jump reduces the damage by 50%."},
    [6690]={name="Ferine Leggings",quality=3,ilvl=34,reqLevel=29,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Agathelos the Raging.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",npc="Agathelos the Raging"},
    [6692]={name="Pronged Reaver",quality=3,ilvl=35,reqLevel=30,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Charlga Razorflank.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",npc="Charlga Razorflank"},
    [6693]={name="Agamaggan's Clutch",quality=3,ilvl=35,reqLevel=30,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Charlga Razorflank.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",npc="Charlga Razorflank"},
    [6696]={name="Nightstalker Bow",quality=3,ilvl=34,reqLevel=29,sourceType="rare_npc",instructions="Drops from Blind Hunter.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",npc="Blind Hunter"},
    [6697]={name="Batwing Mantle",quality=3,ilvl=34,reqLevel=29,sourceType="rare_npc",instructions="Drops from Blind Hunter.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",npc="Blind Hunter"},
    [6719]={name="Windborne Belt",quality=2,ilvl=30,reqLevel=25,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Highperch Venom'. Starts with Fiora Longears in Dustwallow Marsh. Objective: Bring 10 Highperch Venom Sacs to Fiora Longears in Theramore.",zone="Dustwallow Marsh",questName="Highperch Venom",lore="As you may know, wyverns are often tamed by orcs for use as mounts. But what is less known is that the venom of a wyvern, in some circles, is more valuable than the beast itself."},
    [6720]={name="Spirit Hunter Headdress",quality=2,ilvl=37,reqLevel=26,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Frostmaw'. Starts with Melor Stonehoof in Thunder Bluff. Objective: Bring Frostmaw's Mane to Melor Stonehoof in Thunder Bluff.",zone="Thunder Bluff",questName="Frostmaw",lore="it is now time for you to travel to far-off lands. You are ready. You now hunt Frostmaw, a yeti in the Alterac Mountains. He is elusive, his white coat blending into the snows of his mountain home."},
    [6723]={name="Medal of Courage",quality=2,ilvl=47,reqLevel=35,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Saving Yenniku'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Kin'weelay in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: Bring the Filled Soul Gem to Nimboya.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Saving Yenniku",lore="I have reshaped the Mind's Eye into a Soul Gem. Its purpose is twofold: you must use it to stun Yenniku, and once stunned place it upon his head to entrap his soul."},
    [6727]={name="Razzeric's Racing Grips",quality=2,ilvl=41,reqLevel=29,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Safety First'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Shreev in Thousand Needles. Objective: Return the Modified Seaforium Booster to Razzeric on the Shimmering Flats.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Safety First",lore="There, I did what Razzeric wanted. Just tell him to be careful when he sets this off. If he makes the slightest mistake, he won't be moving forward, he'll just be a burnt spot on the track."},
    [6732]={name="Gnomish Mechanic's Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=38,reqLevel=28,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'News for Fizzle'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Martek the Exiled in Thousand Needles. Objective: Speak with Fizzle Brassbolts in the Shimmering Flats.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="News for Fizzle",lore="Indurium has an amazing resistance to heat! I'm sure it will work for Fizzle's pistons. But he'll need true indurium ore, not just the flakes."},
    [6738]={name="Bleeding Crescent",quality=2,ilvl=35,reqLevel=28,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Parts of the Swarm'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Korran in Orgrimmar. Objective: Return to Belgrom Rockmaul in Orgrimmar.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Parts of the Swarm",lore="Head back to Belgrom in Orgrimmar and tell him Moktar be doing his bidding well out in the Thousand Needles. Tell him also, that me studies progress, and I hope to be havin' learned more soon.",proc="Chance on hit: Wounds the target causing them to bleed for 85 damage over 30 sec."},
    [6739]={name="Cliffrunner's Aim",quality=2,ilvl=29,reqLevel=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Sacred Flame'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Rau Cliffrunner in Thousand Needles. Objective: Retrieve the Cloven Hoof for Rau Cliffrunner at the Freewind Post.",zone="Thunder Bluff",questName="The Sacred Flame",lore="Using the water you brought, you will be able to temporarily douse the flame that holds the centaur relic. It will not work permanently, however, so you will have to be quick about it."},
    [6743]={name="Sustaining Ring",quality=2,ilvl=25,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Knowledge in the Deeps'. Starts with Gerrig Bonegrip in Ironforge. Objective: Bring the Lorgalis Manuscript to Gerrig Bonegrip in the Forlorn Cavern in Ironforge.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",questName="Knowledge in the Deeps",lore="As you might know, I collect lore. Old lore. Powerful lore. Lore that opens doorways, and lore that can awaken Those Who Sleep."},
    [6745]={name="Swiftrunner Cape",quality=2,ilvl=33,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Alliance Relations'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Orgrimmar",questName="Alliance Relations",lore="The fight goes well. Perhaps the Warchief will allow us to return to our homes before the seasons change if we continue to make such great strides in our battle against the demons and their underlings."},
    [6748]={name="Monkey Ring",quality=2,ilvl=32,reqLevel=22,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Willix the Importer'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",questName="Willix the Importer",lore="At last, help has arrived! You have no clue how long I've been held prisoner here. I can't remember the last time I saw the outside of this place."},
    [6751]={name="Mourning Shawl",quality=2,ilvl=32,reqLevel=25,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Mortality Wanes'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",questName="Mortality Wanes",lore="I have not long to live... so... so... weak....the b-b-brave dwarf, Lonebrow, has been sent to w-w-warn Falfindel... But before I... d-d-die......my wife, Treshala..."},
    [6752]={name="Lancer Boots",quality=2,ilvl=32,reqLevel=25,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Mortality Wanes'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",questName="Mortality Wanes",lore="I have not long to live... so... so... weak....the b-b-brave dwarf, Lonebrow, has been sent to w-w-warn Falfindel... But before I... d-d-die......my wife, Treshala..."},
    [6757]={name="Jaina's Signet Ring",quality=2,ilvl=38,reqLevel=28,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Missing Diplomat'. Starts with Tapoke \\\"Slim\\\" Jahn in Wetlands. Objective: Speak to Mikhail in the Wetlands.",zone="Stormwind City",questName="The Missing Diplomat"},
    [6784]={name="Braced Handguards",quality=2,ilvl=36,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Centaur Bounty'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Corporal Melkins in Desolace. Objective: Bring 15 Centaur Ears to Corporal Melkins at Nijel's Point in Desolace.",zone="Desolace",questName="Centaur Bounty",lore="Now that you scared the centaur clans, it's time to bleed them. When traveling Desolace, hunt centaur. I don't care which clan you hunt. Just gather ears."},
    [6788]={name="Kolkar Hunter's Belt",quality=2,ilvl=42,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Khan Hratha'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Uthek the Wise in Desolace. Objective: Maintain your reputation with the Gelkis, and bring the Maraudine Key Fragment to Uthek the Wise in the Gelkis Village.",zone="Desolace",questName="Khan Hratha",lore="The Gelkis Khan is dead, and now the Maraudine will fall! Kill the Maraudine Khan, Hratha! To face him, blow the horn on the high bluff in the Valley of Spears."},
    [6794]={name="Stormfire Gauntlets",quality=2,ilvl=40,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Reagents for Reclaimers Inc.'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Kreldig Ungor in Ironforge. Objective: Bring Leftwitch's Package back to Roetten Stonehammer in Ironforge.",zone="Desolace",questName="Reagents for Reclaimers Inc.",lore="To get paid, you're gonna have to get back to Ironforge and speak to Roetten himself. He'll love getting Leftwitch's package out of the way anyway."},
    [6798]={name="Blasting Hackbut",quality=2,ilvl=37,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Questioning Reethe'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Ogron in Dustwallow Marsh. Objective: Go with Ogron to speak with Reethe, then return to Krog in Brackenwall Village.",zone="Dustwallow Marsh",questName="Questioning Reethe",lore="It took a long time, but I found Reethe. He hide good for a human. Ogron worried that he might be crazy after so much time in swamp. You come with me for we go get answers from him."},
    [6802]={name="Sword of Omen",quality=3,ilvl=44,reqLevel=33,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Into The Scarlet Monastery'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Scarlet Monastery",questName="Into The Scarlet Monastery",lore="Whilst the Dark Lady tends to the pressing issue of the Lich King's advance to the north, I am seeing to it that matters closer to home are being taken care of accordingly."},
    [6829]={name="Sword of Serenity",quality=3,ilvl=44,reqLevel=34,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'In the Name of the Light'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Raleigh the Devout in Scarlet Monastery. Objective: Kill High Inquisitor Whitemane, Scarlet Commander Mograine, Herod, the Scarlet Champion and Houndmaster Loksey and then report back to Raleigh the Devout in Southshore.",zone="Scarlet Monastery",questName="In the Name of the Light",lore="I once served the Scarlet Crusade with honor, loyalty and pride. I believed their cause to be a noble one: to rid Azeroth of the undead."},
    [6831]={name="Black Menace",quality=3,ilvl=44,reqLevel=34,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'In the Name of the Light'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Raleigh the Devout in Scarlet Monastery. Objective: Kill High Inquisitor Whitemane, Scarlet Commander Mograine, Herod, the Scarlet Champion and Houndmaster Loksey and then report back to Raleigh the Devout in Southshore.",zone="Scarlet Monastery",questName="In the Name of the Light",lore="I once served the Scarlet Crusade with honor, loyalty and pride. I believed their cause to be a noble one: to rid Azeroth of the undead.",proc="Chance on hit: Sends a shadowy bolt at the enemy causing 77 Shadow damage."},
    [6902]={name="Bands of Serra'kis",quality=3,ilvl=27,reqLevel=22,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Old Serra'kis.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",npc="Old Serra'kis",lore="Serra'kis is the great water beast the naga breed in the flooded halls of Blackfathom Deeps, and the reason the lower temple is under water at all."},
    [6904]={name="Bite of Serra'kis",quality=3,ilvl=28,reqLevel=23,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Old Serra'kis.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",npc="Old Serra'kis",proc="Chance on hit: Poisons target for 14 Nature damage every 3 sec for 9 sec."},
    [6998]={name="Nimbus Boots",quality=2,ilvl=27,reqLevel=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Twilight Falls'. Starts with Argent Guard Manados in Darnassus. Objective: Bring 10 Twilight Pendants to Argent Guard Manados in Darnassus.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",questName="Twilight Falls",lore="Empowered by the ancient rites of the chaotic Old Gods the members of the Twilight's Hammer strive to bring about the return of their dark patrons and spread death and terror across the world."},
    [7281]={name="Light Leather Bracers",quality=2,ilvl=14,reqLevel=9,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Leatherworking (requires skill 45).",profession="Leatherworking"},
    [7282]={name="Light Leather Pants",quality=2,ilvl=19,reqLevel=14,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Leatherworking (requires skill 70).",profession="Leatherworking"},
