    [15398]={name="Sandcomber Boots",quality=1,ilvl=14,reqLevel=11,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Washed Ashore'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde in Darkshore. Objective: Recover the Sea Turtle Remains from the Skeletal Sea Turtle in the waters west of Auberdine, and then speak with Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde back in Auberdine.",zone="Darkshore",questName="Washed Ashore",lore="That beached creature is not an isolated incident here in Darkshore. There are more along the coastline and even in the water."},
    [15403]={name="Ridgeback Bracers",quality=2,ilvl=18,reqLevel=15,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'WANTED: Murkdeep!'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Darkshore",questName="WANTED: Murkdeep!",lore="Attention! A reward is being offered for the death of the murloc \"Murkdeep\"."},
    [15411]={name="Mark of Fordring",quality=3,ilvl=63,reqLevel=52,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'In Dreams'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Highlord Taelan Fordring in Western Plaguelands. Objective: Escort Taelan Fordring out of Hearthglen.",zone="Western Plaguelands",questName="In Dreams",lore="For so long, I have been a puppet of the Grand Crusader. What reason was there to fight against what the Scarlet Crusade had become?",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to get a critical strike by 1.0%."},
    [15431]={name="Peerless Leggings",quality=2,ilvl=59,reqLevel=54,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 38-61."},
    [15443]={name="Kris of Orgrimmar",quality=3,ilvl=18,reqLevel=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Hidden Enemies'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Thrall in Ragefire Chasm. Objective: Kill Bazzalan and Jergosh the Invoker before returning to Thrall in Orgrimmar.",zone="Orgrimmar",questName="Hidden Enemies",lore="You are one of my lieutenants! Prepare yourself. I will call upon you soon. My time spent on the Searing Blade may be all but wasted now, but that does not mean that the Shadow Council's schemes elsewhere must suffer."},
    [15445]={name="Hammer of Orgrimmar",quality=3,ilvl=18,reqLevel=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Hidden Enemies'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Thrall in Ragefire Chasm. Objective: Kill Bazzalan and Jergosh the Invoker before returning to Thrall in Orgrimmar.",zone="Orgrimmar",questName="Hidden Enemies",lore="You are one of my lieutenants! Prepare yourself. I will call upon you soon. My time spent on the Searing Blade may be all but wasted now, but that does not mean that the Shadow Council's schemes elsewhere must suffer."},
    [15450]={name="Dredgemire Leggings",quality=2,ilvl=18,reqLevel=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Power to Destroy...'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Varimathras in Undercity. Objective: Bring the books Spells of Shadow and Incantations from the Nether to Varimathras in Undercity.",zone="Ragefire Chasm",questName="The Power to Destroy...",lore="Many denizens of the Legion bestow gifts on their followers as you may well know. Some of these gifts the Dark Lady feels would be better off in her hands than in the hands of those with..."},
    [15453]={name="Savannah Bracers",quality=2,ilvl=18,reqLevel=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Returning the Lost Satchel'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Maur Grimtotem in Thunder Bluff. Objective: Take the Grimtotem Satchel to Rahauro in Thunder Bluff.",zone="Ragefire Chasm",questName="Returning the Lost Satchel",lore="You find a satchel under the body of the tauren. It is still gripped tightly in his arms as though he was trying to protect it while being attacked by the troggs."},
    [15456]={name="Lightstep Leggings",quality=2,ilvl=37,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Hints of a New Plague?'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Quae in Hillsbrad Foothills. Objective: Find Phin Odelic in Southshore.",zone="Hillsbrad Foothills",questName="Hints of a New Plague?",lore="I've seen Kinelory look way worse after a night in the tavern than she does now. You obviously did a good job protecting her."},
    [15457]={name="Desert Shoulders",quality=2,ilvl=28,reqLevel=24,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Grimtotem Spying'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Cliffwatcher Longhorn in Thousand Needles. Objective: Locate and retrieve the three Secret Notes in Darkcloud Pinnacle.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Grimtotem Spying",lore="you have served us well in the past, so I now entrust to you an important mission. The Grimtotem Clan is up to something secretive. Three agents of unknown origin were seen visiting the Grimtotem over the recent weeks."},
    [15462]={name="Loamflake Bracers",quality=2,ilvl=25,reqLevel=23,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Protect Kanati Greycloud'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Thousand Needles. Objective: Protect Kanati Greycloud from the centaur attack.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Protect Kanati Greycloud",lore="But, there may be more centaur than I thought, I ask you, to fight with me against these vile assassins."},
    [15469]={name="Windsong Cinch",quality=2,ilvl=29,reqLevel=25,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Free at Last'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Lakota Windsong in Thousand Needles. Objective: Escort Lakota Windsong from the Darkcloud Pinnacle, and then talk to Thalia Amberhide at Freewind Post.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Free at Last",lore="Arnak thinks we're going to be married... but after I declined his offer he came back that night and kidnapped me. My brother tried to stop him, but Arnak was too strong."},
    [15471]={name="Brawnhide Armor",quality=2,ilvl=29,reqLevel=25,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Wanted - Arnak Grimtotem'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Thousand Needles. Objective: Slay Arnak Grimtotem and bring proof of your deed to Cliffwatcher Longhorn in Freewind Post.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Wanted - Arnak Grimtotem",lore="Wanted: Arnak Grimtotem Arnak the outcast is wanted for the heinous crimes of murder and kidnapping. Handsome rewards will be given to those brave enough to bring this criminal to justice."},
    [15501]={name="Outrunner's Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=17,reqLevel=12,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 11-18."},
    [15508]={name="Grunt's Cape",quality=2,ilvl=19,reqLevel=14,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 14-20."},
    [15519]={name="Spiked Chain Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=23,reqLevel=18,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 18-24."},
    [15526]={name="Sentry's Cape",quality=2,ilvl=24,reqLevel=19,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 19-26."},
    [15559]={name="Pillager's Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=31,reqLevel=26,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 26-32.",zone="Tirisfal Glades",zoneOpen=true},
    [15587]={name="Ringtail Girdle",quality=2,ilvl=35,reqLevel=31,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Clam Bait'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Mai'Lahii in Desolace. Objective: Find 10 pieces of Soft-shelled Clam Meat and bring it back to Mai'Lahii at Shadowprey Village.",zone="Desolace",questName="Clam Bait",lore="You have the look of a fisherman! I love to fish - been fishing all my life. The best bait to use is soft-shelled clam meat; the fish just can't resist, you know what I mean?"},
    [15594]={name="Steadfast Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=37,reqLevel=32,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 32-39."},
    [15661]={name="Impenetrable Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=54,reqLevel=49,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 48-55."},
    [15691]={name="Sidegunner Shottie",quality=2,ilvl=38,reqLevel=32,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Gizelton Caravan'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Rigger Gizelton in Desolace. Objective: Escort the Gizelton Caravan through Mannoroc Coven. Talk with Smeed at Scrabblescrew's Camp for your reward.",zone="Desolace",questName="Gizelton Caravan",lore="You look like a capable. Perhaps you're looking to make some money? Cork and I started this caravan to make a bundle of money; little did we know the dangers of turning a buck!"},
    [15703]={name="Chemist's Smock",quality=2,ilvl=55,reqLevel=48,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Melding of Influences'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Chemist Fuely in Undercity. Objective: Bring a Merged Ooze Sample to Chemist Fuely in Undercity.",zone="Undercity",questName="Melding of Influences",lore="Here is some encased ooze created from the Felwood samples you recovered. Take the case to Un'Goro Crater and find a pure ooze... the primal variety will do nicely."},
    [15704]={name="Hunter's Insignia Medal",quality=2,ilvl=60,reqLevel=53,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Past Endeavors'. The quest is in Winterspring. Objective: Bring Storm Shadowhoof's Marker to Melor Stonehoof in Thunder Bluff.",zone="Winterspring",questName="Past Endeavors",lore="Before you spoke to me, I had heard of your endeavors... that you had an unyielding desire to prove yourself, that you had an exceptional ability as a, and I now know these things to be the truth."},
    [15705]={name="Tidecrest Blade",quality=2,ilvl=57,reqLevel=49,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Remains of Trey Lightforge'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Felwood. Objective: Return the Remains of Trey Lightforge to Jessir Moonbow in Felwood.",zone="Felwood",questName="The Remains of Trey Lightforge",lore="You pick up the sack carefully and prepare to make your way back to Jessir Moonbow on the border of Felwood and Ashenvale. Hopefully the paladin will be given the proper respects once you've passed his remains on to his friends."},
    [15707]={name="Brantwood Sash",quality=2,ilvl=58,reqLevel=48,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'A Final Blow'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Greta Mosshoof in Felwood. Objective: Kill Moora and Salia, and bring Shadow Lord Fel'dan's Head to Greta Mosshoof in Felwood.",zone="Felwood",questName="A Final Blow",lore="Unfortunately, I see the only way to stop this threat to Felwood is a frontal attack. There are no other ways into Shadow Hold, and I have no means to teleport you inside."},
    [15708]={name="Blight Leather Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=58,reqLevel=48,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'A Final Blow'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Greta Mosshoof in Felwood. Objective: Kill Moora and Salia, and bring Shadow Lord Fel'dan's Head to Greta Mosshoof in Felwood.",zone="Felwood",questName="A Final Blow",lore="Unfortunately, I see the only way to stop this threat to Felwood is a frontal attack. There are no other ways into Shadow Hold, and I have no means to teleport you inside."},
    [15789]={name="Deep River Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=56,reqLevel=51,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Strange Sources'. Starts with Donova Snowden in Winterspring. Objective: Follow Donova Snowden's instructions, then report back.",zone="Winterspring",questName="Strange Sources",lore="To tell you the truth, although there are no volcanoes here in Winterspring, I believe that there are far more threatening reasons for these hot springs..."},
    [15791]={name="Turquoise Sash",quality=2,ilvl=58,reqLevel=53,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Crystal of Zin-Malor'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Wynd Nightchaser in Darnassus. Objective: Deliver the Crystal of Zin-Malor to Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm in Darnassus.",zone="Winterspring",questName="The Crystal of Zin-Malor",lore="Quite impressive. The crystal of Zin-Malor can never be returned to the temple which, as you know, lies in ruin. But I believe that your effort to undo the evil of the past should not go unrewarded."},
    [15804]={name="Cerise Drape",quality=2,ilvl=56,reqLevel=51,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Glyphed Oaken Branch'. Starts with Mulgris Deepriver in Darnassus. Objective: Based on the magic enchanted within the Glyphed Oaken Branch, its delivery to the Cenarion Circle in Darnassus is the next step the tauren druid sought. Seek one of the druids there for assistance.",zone="Western Plaguelands",questName="Glyphed Oaken Branch",lore="The lifeless hand of the tauren druid clutches a surprisingly healthy looking oaken branch. Examining the branch reveals glyphs of a druidic nature carved into the bark."},
    [15806]={name="Mirah's Song",quality=3,ilvl=61,reqLevel=55,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Kirtonos the Herald'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Eva Sarkhoff in Scholomance. Objective: Return to the Scholomance with the Blood of Innocents. Find the porch and place the Blood of Innocents in the brazier. Kirtonos will come to feast upon your soul.Fight valiantly, do not give an inch! Destroy Kirtonos and return to Eva Sarkhoff.",zone="Scholomance",questName="Kirtonos the Herald",lore="Mirah Chandler's song, given for finishing a chain of favours in the Barrens -- the reward players remember long after they forget the errands."},
    [15814]={name="Hameya's Slayer",quality=2,ilvl=60,reqLevel=54,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Hameya's Plea'. The quest is in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: Kill Infiltrator Hameya. Use his key on the Mound of Dirt behind the Undercroft.",zone="Eastern Plaguelands",questName="Hameya's Plea",lore="Kill me. Before it's too late. I am Hameya. While traveling to Zul'Mashar, my brethren and I ate some bad meat... and we changed. We are infected.",proc="Chance on hit: Wounds the target causing them to bleed for 80 damage over 30 sec."},
    [15822]={name="Shadowskin Spaulders",quality=2,ilvl=55,reqLevel=50,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Runecloth'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Meilosh in Felwood. Objective: Bring 30 Runecloth to Meilosh in Timbermaw Hold.",zone="Felwood",questName="Runecloth",lore="In Timbermaw, we are content. We do not like strangers. This is good for us, but it is bad for trade. Not long ago, a rare night elf friend came to Timbermaw and she wore a runecloth cloak."},
    [15825]={name="Traphook Jerkin",quality=2,ilvl=59,reqLevel=55,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Put Her Down'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Helendis Riverhorn in Blackrock Spire. Objective: Travel to Blackrock Spire and destroy the source of the worg menace. As you left Helendis, he shouted a name: Halycon. It is what the orcs refer to in regards to the worg.",zone="Blackrock Spire",questName="Put Her Down",lore="You have no doubt seen the worgs which the Blackrock orcs command. It is curious - no matter how many we destroy, their numbers never dwindle."},
    [15855]={name="Ring of Protection",quality=3,ilvl=60,reqLevel=50,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Hidden Treasures'. Starts with Pamela Redpath in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: Bring Joseph's Key to Joseph's Chest.",zone="Eastern Plaguelands",questName="Hidden Treasures",lore="Daddy told me to give you this key. He said it opens a chest out back behind the house. He also wanted me to thank you. Did you do a favor for him?"},
    [15861]={name="Swiftfoot Treads",quality=2,ilvl=60,reqLevel=57,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Delivery to Ridgewell'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Mayara Brightwing in Stormwind City. Objective: Bring Ridgewell's Crate to Remington Ridgewell in Stormwind.",zone="Blackrock Spire",questName="Delivery to Ridgewell",lore="I have packaged Doomriggers Clasp into a crate, suitable for shipment to Stormwind., you have been extremely helpful -- can I ask you for one last favor?"},
    [15995]={name="Thorium Rifle",quality=2,ilvl=52,reqLevel=47,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Engineering (requires skill 260). The Engineering pattern is the drop.",profession="Engineering"},
    [16007]={name="Flawless Arcanite Rifle",quality=3,ilvl=61,reqLevel=56,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Engineering (requires skill 300).",profession="Engineering"},
